==French==

===Etymology===
Literally meaning "to [[crunch]] the [[apple]]." Referencing the {{w|Book of Genesis}}, in which {{w|Eve}} eats the {{w|Forbidden fruit}}, commonly thought of as an [[apple]], from the {{w|Tree of the knowledge of good and evil}}. An [[allegory]] to the [[sin]] of [[knowledge]] and [[lust]].

